  'DW relays the same words of Sinkevicius, citing LRT: the drone is of Ukrainian origin, as confirmed by the wreckage and the Ukrainian side\'s statement; fighter jets saw the object on radar but could not establish visual contact because of the weather, and the cause of the crash has not yet been established. DW recalls that Ukraine\'s Foreign Ministry expressed regret and attributed the incident to possible Russian electronic warfare. The Kyiv Independent reports Tusk\'s demand for an explanation "without emotion" and his words on the Polish state\'s consent to any operations, noting that Polish authorities have been unable to confirm the drone passed through Poland, and that Vilnius has echoed Kyiv\'s version of a drone diverted by Russian jamming during the attack on St Petersburg.'))
